    |= Color |= Resource Type |
    | <#E3F2FD> | Network |
    | <#FFF3E0> | Security |
    | <#E8F5E9> | Compute |
    | <#FCE4EC> | Storage |
    | <#F3E5F5> | Database |
endlegend

